				Time="2011-11-16T11:04:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ざざ　ざり　ざ……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="suginaka_katsunori:W00289"
				Time="2011-11-16T11:04:11" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="suginaka_katsunori:W00289"
				Time="2011-11-16T11:04:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>ポケモン
・あわせて鳴き声再生
・続けて戦闘に</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="suginaka_katsunori:W00289"
				Time="2011-11-16T11:04:11" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>POKE
ポケモン・レジロック</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="suginaka_katsunori:W00289"
				Time="2011-11-16T11:04:11" />
		</AttributeCell>
